 478:source\asw/main.c **** /**
 479:source\asw/main.c ****  * \brief Button interrupt: turn the pressed buttons into events for tsk_control.
 480:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 481:source\asw/main.c ****  * Checks the four buttons and sets one event per pressed button (ev_Button1..ev_Button4).
 482:source\asw/main.c ****  * Several buttons pressed at the same time give several events. The events are handled
 483:source\asw/main.c ****  * in tsk_control (N4); the ISR itself does no work with the player.
 484:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 485:source\asw/main.c ****  * \note ISR category 2 (OS services allowed).
 486:source\asw/main.c ****  */
